# Databricks Medallion Pipeline — Project Standards

## Language / stack
- Python, PySpark, SQL, Delta Lake, Databricks

## Code style
- Follow PEP 8
- Use type hints where practical
- Include docstrings on all functions

## Script header
- Every script must include a comment block at the top explaining its purpose, inputs, and outputs

## Silver layer quality
- The Silver layer must NEVER delete bad rows
- Always flag invalid or suspect records with a `quality_check_result` column

## Paths and configuration
- No hardcoded file paths
- Use config variables at the top of each script

## SQL formatting
- Uppercase SQL keywords
- One clause per line
